  "description": "The meme is designed for an audience familiar with or interested in internet humor, particularly dark humor, that exploits real-world events or public figures for shock value. The target audience likely includes individuals who are aware of the 2015 incident involving Ahmed Mohamed and may be familiar with the name's association with Islamophobia. The meme appeals to those who find provocative or controversial content amusing, even if it is harmful or misleading. The audience may also include those who are indifferent to the real-world consequences of such memes, or who are drawn to the meme for its satirical or ironic tone, regardless of its harmful intent.",
